OL,3,GNEWSANew CCTV shows missing woman's
OL,4,Amovements
OL,5,
OL,6,FPolice have released new CCTV images of
OL,7,Fa missing woman as they appeal to
OL,8,Fanyone who may have seen her.
OL,10,FThe footage shows Eren Wright, 29, in a
OL,11,Fshop on Park Road in St Annes on the
OL,12,FFylde coast in Lancashire, at about
OL,13,F16:30 GMT on 27 October, Lancashire
OL,14,FPolice said.
OL,16,FOfficers believe she may then have
OL,17,Ftravelled to the Fairhaven Lake area,
OL,18,Fbetween Lytham and St Annes, where she
OL,19,Fcould have been from about 17:30.
OL,23,APub: 08-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
